{
    "title": "Trivia Crush",
    "description": "Have fun playing the hottest trivia game! With over 100 categories to choose from, there\u2019s something there for everyone!\r\n\r\nTrivia Crush has a massive variety of questions and heaps of unlockable achievements for trivia addicts! Test your knowledge, join the laughter, nerves, & nail-biting tension, and prove you are the ultimate quiz head today!\r\n\r\nTrivia Crush Features:\r\n- A new way of looking at trivia games\r\n- Hundreds of thousands of exciting questions\r\n- Over 100 categories to choose from including: animals, celebrities, food, sports, music, movies, TV shows, logos, history and more!\r\n- Learn something new while having fun\r\n- Tons of Trivia Categories for multiple choice quiz questions\r\n- Use Classic lifelines such as 50:50 and Ask an expert\r\n- Play anytime anywhere\r\n- Tease your brain and put your knowledge to the test on-the-go",
    "descriptionHTML": "Have fun playing the hottest trivia game! With over 100 categories to choose from, there\u2019s something there for everyone!<br><br>Trivia Crush has a massive variety of questions and heaps of unlockable achievements for trivia addicts! Test your knowledge, join the laughter, nerves, &amp; nail-biting tension, and prove you are the ultimate quiz head today!<br><br>Trivia Crush Features:<br>- A new way of looking at trivia games<br>- Hundreds of thousands of exciting questions<br>- Over 100 categories to choose from including: animals, celebrities, food, sports, music, movies, TV shows, logos, history and more!<br>- Learn something new while having fun<br>- Tons of Trivia Categories for multiple choice quiz questions<br>- Use Classic lifelines such as 50:50 and Ask an expert<br>- Play anytime anywhere<br>- Tease your brain and put your knowledge to the test on-the-go",
